1
00:00:05,660 --> 00:00:07,480
Go on, then. However,

2
00:00:07,840 --> 00:00:13,940
if I detect even a trace of deceit
in your words, I shall end your life.

3
00:00:15,600 --> 00:00:16,720
Fine by me.

4
00:00:17,080 --> 00:00:18,997
You should do what you think is right.

5
00:00:19,080 --> 00:00:22,139
As long as you're not just
blindly following orders.

6
00:00:24,060 --> 00:00:26,757
I say that because you
won't know the difference.

7
00:00:26,840 --> 00:00:27,977
You don't realize it.

8
00:00:28,060 --> 00:00:30,597
But everything you've
been fighting for as a

9
00:00:30,680 --> 00:00:33,740
knight was planted in
your head by someone else.

10
00:00:34,700 --> 00:00:36,280
Everyone knows this story,

11
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:39,777
that you knights were called down
from heaven by Administrator,

12
00:00:39,860 --> 00:00:41,448
the pontifex of the church,

13
00:00:41,660 --> 00:00:44,800
to maintain order in this
world and dole out justice.

14
00:00:45,100 --> 00:00:48,394
But being summoned's the
oldest memory you knights have.

15
00:00:49,320 --> 00:00:50,280
Think back.

16
00:00:50,560 --> 00:00:52,860
Do you remember what heaven was like?

17
00:00:52,980 --> 00:00:54,039
Or your childhood?

18
00:00:54,340 --> 00:00:55,281
Or your parents?

19
00:00:56,360 --> 00:00:57,200
Well, no.

20
00:00:57,620 --> 00:00:58,660
Of course not.

21
00:00:58,900 --> 00:01:01,017
Our memories of heaven have been sealed.

22
00:01:01,100 --> 00:01:05,277
I was told the goddess Stacia does
that the moment we are summoned here.

23
00:01:05,360 --> 00:01:08,277
You get the part about your
memories being sealed, right?

24
00:01:08,360 --> 00:01:10,917
But Stacia isn't the
one who did that to you.

25
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:14,497
It was the Pontifex, and she
didn't block memories of heaven,

26
00:01:14,580 --> 00:01:16,220
but your memories of here.

27
00:01:16,880 --> 00:01:20,857
All you knights were born and raised
human, right here in this world.

28
00:01:20,940 --> 00:01:22,600
You have a human name.

29
00:01:23,040 --> 00:01:24,180
Alice Zuberg.

30
00:01:24,540 --> 00:01:28,620
Your folks raised you in a tiny
village up north called Rulid.

31
00:01:29,640 --> 00:01:30,880
When you were eleven,

32
00:01:31,220 --> 00:01:36,017
you went to explore a cave that ran through
the End Mountains to the Dark Territory.

33
00:01:36,100 --> 00:01:40,159
When you came out the other side,
you touched the ground on accident.

34
00:01:40,500 --> 00:01:42,720
You trespassed on the Dark Territory.

35
00:01:43,020 --> 00:01:44,520
You broke the law.

36
00:01:51,740 --> 00:01:53,137
Alice Zuburg.

37
00:01:53,220 --> 00:01:55,837
I have a human name?

38
00:01:55,920 --> 00:01:57,780
The End Mountains. Unruled.

39
00:01:58,160 --> 00:01:59,640
I cannot remember.

40
00:01:59,960 --> 00:02:00,900
None of it.

41
00:02:01,200 --> 00:02:02,877
Yeah, well, don't force yourself.

42
00:02:02,960 --> 00:02:04,489
You'll end up like Eldrie.

43
00:02:05,880 --> 00:02:08,617
It is too late to stop now. Go on.

44
00:02:08,700 --> 00:02:10,700
Tell me everything.

45
00:02:19,500 --> 00:02:21,217
Thank you

46
00:02:21,300 --> 00:02:28,300
so

47
00:02:30,040 --> 00:02:31,099
much for watching.

48
00:03:27,460 --> 00:03:28,457
Thank

49
00:03:28,540 --> 00:03:29,437
you

50
00:03:29,520 --> 00:03:36,520
so

51
00:03:45,140 --> 00:03:46,199
much for watching.

52
00:03:50,360 --> 00:03:52,820
Your father's the village elder of Rulid.

53
00:03:53,040 --> 00:03:54,920
His name's Gosfut Zuburg.

54
00:03:56,100 --> 00:04:00,982
I don't know your mom's name, but like I
told you before, you have a little sister.

55
00:04:01,100 --> 00:04:01,940
I met her.

56
00:04:02,160 --> 00:04:03,360
Her name's Selka.

57
00:04:04,480 --> 00:04:05,310
Selka?

58
00:04:05,393 --> 00:04:09,498
Ever since you were taken away by
the church, she's been worried sick.

59
00:04:09,780 --> 00:04:12,937
When you lived in Rulid, you
were a sister in training?

60
00:04:13,020 --> 00:04:15,079
and really good at the sacred arts.

61
00:04:15,360 --> 00:04:16,190
Now,

62
00:04:16,273 --> 00:04:17,837
Selka's a sister in training, too,

63
00:04:17,920 --> 00:04:21,273
and she's working hard to get
as good at the arts as you.

64
00:04:22,540 --> 00:04:24,500
Your goal, as you stated,

65
00:04:24,840 --> 00:04:27,280
was not treason against the Church,

66
00:04:27,540 --> 00:04:32,320
but to bring the Pontifex to justice
and protect the human realm, yes?

67
00:04:32,660 --> 00:04:34,700
Yeah, that's the plan.

68
00:04:35,040 --> 00:04:40,380
And yet, we Integrity Knights have a
duty to protect the human realm as well.

69
00:04:41,100 --> 00:04:45,440
We defend it against invasion by
the Dark Territory at all costs.

70
00:04:46,440 --> 00:04:49,477
If you manage to defeat all
of the Integrity Knights,

71
00:04:49,560 --> 00:04:53,340
as well as slay the
Pontifex herself, what then?

72
00:04:53,540 --> 00:04:56,077
There would be no one
to protect this realm.

73
00:04:56,160 --> 00:04:57,800
Well, let me ask you this.

74
00:04:58,260 --> 00:05:02,197
If the Dark Territory invades and all
of you knights hit him full force,

75
00:05:02,280 --> 00:05:03,937
that's only going to be, what,

76
00:05:04,020 --> 00:05:05,460
a little over 30 of you?

77
00:05:05,680 --> 00:05:08,798
Do you honestly think that's
enough to beat him back?

78
00:05:11,460 --> 00:05:16,100
Prime Senator, you need to talk to
the Pontifex about the Dark Territory.

79
00:05:16,800 --> 00:05:21,212
Every day their army gets bigger, it's
a matter of time before they attack.

80
00:05:21,300 --> 00:05:24,857
I'm worried there's not enough of
us knights to take them all on.

81
00:05:24,940 --> 00:05:26,280
That's your problem!

82
00:05:26,640 --> 00:05:30,934
You are Integrity Knights, so use your
brains and figure it out yourself!

83
00:05:31,360 --> 00:05:33,184
We are done talking about this!

84
00:05:33,620 --> 00:05:37,277
Trust in the Pontifex, do as
you're told, and all will be fine!

85
00:05:37,360 --> 00:05:38,190
Honestly!

86
00:05:43,320 --> 00:05:44,797
Actually, you're right.

87
00:05:44,880 --> 00:05:46,680
Even Unc - or rather,

88
00:05:47,120 --> 00:05:51,177
Commander Bercoli had misgivings
about our numbers compared to theirs.

89
00:05:51,260 --> 00:05:52,554
Aside from us knights,

90
00:05:52,660 --> 00:05:57,000
the Human Empire does not have an army
at the ready should war break out.

91
00:05:57,900 --> 00:06:02,020
I know, and the reason we don't have
an army is Administrator's fault.

92
00:06:02,380 --> 00:06:03,740
You know why that is?

93
00:06:03,900 --> 00:06:06,577
It's because she's scared that
if the people had weapons,

94
00:06:06,660 --> 00:06:08,740
they could all rise up against her.

95
00:06:09,220 --> 00:06:13,280
If a war happens, the nobles are
supposed to protect the weak.

96
00:06:13,540 --> 00:06:15,720
But she let the upper class get lazy.

97
00:06:16,020 --> 00:06:17,080
And corrupt.

98
00:06:17,380 --> 00:06:19,498
They just care about themselves now.

99
00:06:19,800 --> 00:06:22,857
This world's running out of
time, but it still has a chance.

100
00:06:22,940 --> 00:06:27,587
If we can get the word out before the
armies of the Dark show up, we can fight.

101
00:06:27,820 --> 00:06:30,357
With enough people, we
can build our own army.

102
00:06:30,440 --> 00:06:32,500
That is impossible. An army?

103
00:06:33,100 --> 00:06:35,520
You just said how corrupt the nobles are.

104
00:06:35,780 --> 00:06:39,117
They would protect their own
interests before anyone else.

105
00:06:39,200 --> 00:06:40,680
Yeah, some of them.

106
00:06:40,900 --> 00:06:43,312
But they're just a small group of people.

107
00:06:43,640 --> 00:06:45,581
Not everyone thinks like they do.

108
00:06:45,960 --> 00:06:50,137
The lower class nobles and commoners
would join the fight in a heartbeat.

109
00:06:50,220 --> 00:06:51,640
The commoners, too?

110
00:06:52,460 --> 00:06:53,290
Uh-huh.

111
00:06:53,373 --> 00:06:57,777
All we do is hand out the weapons you
guys have got stashed here in the tower.

112
00:06:57,860 --> 00:07:02,507
Then, we teach everyone the same sword
skills and sacred arts you knights know.

113
00:07:02,720 --> 00:07:05,896
If we do that, we could build
an army in a year or so.

114
00:07:06,420 --> 00:07:11,200
Thing is, at this point, it can't happen
if the Pontifex is still in charge.

115
00:07:11,620 --> 00:07:14,217
You know what scares her more
than the forces of the dark?

116
00:07:14,300 --> 00:07:16,006
It's people having free will.

117
00:07:16,400 --> 00:07:20,057
If she can't have an army loyal
to her, there won't be an army.

118
00:07:20,140 --> 00:07:22,220
So I say, we throw a coup.

119
00:07:22,660 --> 00:07:26,117
If we can bring down Administrator,
we'll free all the people.

120
00:07:26,200 --> 00:07:29,637
Then we can use the time we got
left to train them all to fight.

121
00:07:29,720 --> 00:07:33,838
And with any luck, we'll have an
army big enough to stop the invasion.

122
00:07:36,600 --> 00:07:38,900
The fact these minions are here,

123
00:07:39,640 --> 00:07:43,900
that alone is proof of the contempt
that Pontifex has for us knights,

124
00:07:44,240 --> 00:07:47,940
her most loyal servants, and the people.

125
00:08:03,980 --> 00:08:05,000
All right, then.

126
00:08:06,740 --> 00:08:08,960
I'll help, under one condition.

127
00:08:09,600 --> 00:08:15,400
I want your word that when I regain my
memory, I will get to see my sister, Selka,

128
00:08:15,800 --> 00:08:16,630
again.

129
00:08:21,340 --> 00:08:23,360
Yeah, of course. You will.

130
00:08:23,620 --> 00:08:25,800
It's just, when you do get it back,

131
00:08:26,060 --> 00:08:29,178
you're not going to be who
you are right now anymore.

132
00:08:29,960 --> 00:08:32,877
Alice Synthesis 30 The
Integrity Knight will be gone,

133
00:08:32,960 --> 00:08:36,140
and all the memories you
have now will be gone.

134
00:08:37,020 --> 00:08:41,680
You'll go back to being Alice Zuburg,
the girl from a village up north.

135
00:08:46,880 --> 00:08:47,920
Selka. Selka.

136
00:08:51,100 --> 00:08:57,240
I cannot remember her face, or her
voice, but when I say her name,

137
00:08:57,600 --> 00:08:58,860
it is familiar to me.

138
00:08:59,300 --> 00:09:01,777
My lips, throat, and heart.

139
00:09:01,860 --> 00:09:03,280
They remember.

140
00:09:07,280 --> 00:09:11,860
I used to say that name
all the time. Selka. Selka.

141
00:09:18,400 --> 00:09:19,997
I know in my soul.

142
00:09:20,080 --> 00:09:22,500
I have a family.

143
00:09:23,860 --> 00:09:27,037
A father, a mother, a sister.

144
00:09:27,120 --> 00:09:29,140
My own flesh and blood.

145
00:09:31,260 --> 00:09:33,097
Somewhere out there.

146
00:09:33,180 --> 00:09:34,940
Under the stars.

147
00:09:56,660 --> 00:10:02,900
When you said before that we knights were
not called but created by the Pontifex,

148
00:10:03,200 --> 00:10:05,520
it confirmed what I have suspected.

149
00:10:06,260 --> 00:10:10,780
This body, the one I have been
occupying for the past six years.

150
00:10:11,860 --> 00:10:13,700
Was stolen from another.

151
00:10:14,040 --> 00:10:15,520
I know that now.

152
00:10:17,060 --> 00:10:19,560
Therefore, I shall return what was stolen.

153
00:10:20,500 --> 00:10:24,940
It is what Selka, her parents,
and your friend would want.

154
00:10:25,500 --> 00:10:29,480
I am sure you would want
that as well, yes? Oh yeah.

155
00:10:30,080 --> 00:10:34,760
But first, I have one favor to ask. What?

156
00:10:35,220 --> 00:10:36,300
If you would,

157
00:10:36,660 --> 00:10:39,377
before you return the
original Alice's memory,

158
00:10:39,460 --> 00:10:42,760
I would like you to accompany
me to Rulid village.

159
00:10:43,160 --> 00:10:46,760
I wish to visit there, but
I do not want to be seen.

160
00:10:47,820 --> 00:10:52,360
Just observe, and if you would,
please point Selka and my family out.

161
00:10:53,600 --> 00:10:57,320
Grant me that, and I
would be most grateful.

162
00:10:58,300 --> 00:10:59,130
Sure.

163
00:10:59,440 --> 00:11:00,440
You got it.

164
00:11:00,680 --> 00:11:01,760
I swear.

165
00:11:02,560 --> 00:11:06,678
Before we restore your memory, I'll
take you back to Rulid to see him.

166
00:11:07,000 --> 00:11:08,120
You had better.

167
00:11:25,220 --> 00:11:27,400
From this moment onward,

168
00:11:27,660 --> 00:11:31,580
I shall protect the human empire
and its citizens in earnest.

169
00:11:31,940 --> 00:11:36,960
I, Alice Synthesis 30, hereby abandon
my rank as an Integrity Knight.

170
00:11:39,460 --> 00:11:40,980
What's wrong?

171
00:11:44,020 --> 00:11:45,340
Alice!

172
00:11:47,440 --> 00:11:48,760
Kitty.

173
00:11:52,540 --> 00:11:54,200
Let me see.

174
00:11:59,460 --> 00:12:03,480
It looks like a barcode.

175
00:12:03,800 --> 00:12:05,060
What the hell?

176
00:12:08,520 --> 00:12:14,597
My eye it burns so I
see symbols words don't

177
00:12:14,680 --> 00:12:17,017
think about anything
hurry clear your mind.

178
00:12:17,100 --> 00:12:19,957
What's happening is when
you defied the church

179
00:12:20,040 --> 00:12:21,897
it triggered some kind of mental barrier.

180
00:12:21,980 --> 00:12:24,377
That's what's causing the pain and if you

181
00:12:24,460 --> 00:12:27,107
keep thinking about it
your eye will explode?

182
00:12:33,180 --> 00:12:34,437
How cruel.

183
00:12:34,520 --> 00:12:39,337
Not only are my memories
zampered with, but my will.

184
00:12:39,420 --> 00:12:40,437
Even that.

185
00:12:40,520 --> 00:12:43,297
Whoever did this is evil.

186
00:12:43,380 --> 00:12:49,857
Tell me, is the one who burned these,
these words onto my eye, was it her?

187
00:12:49,940 --> 00:12:51,880
Was it the Pontifex?

188
00:12:52,440 --> 00:12:54,917
No, I don't think it's her.

189
00:12:55,000 --> 00:12:58,800
It's a creator, watching
this world from the outside.

190
00:12:59,260 --> 00:13:02,760
Like a god, but not like the
ones in your creation story.

191
00:13:05,080 --> 00:13:07,860
God, we knights are their servants.

192
00:13:08,240 --> 00:13:11,180
We have fought endlessly in their name.

193
00:13:11,640 --> 00:13:16,597
We protect their world, yet
they do not even trust us.

194
00:13:16,680 --> 00:13:21,217
They took my memories
of my family and sister.

195
00:13:21,300 --> 00:13:24,997
They cast this diabolical hex on me!

196
00:13:25,080 --> 00:13:28,380
To ensure my servitude to them.

197
00:13:29,300 --> 00:13:31,380
I am not a puppet!

198
00:13:32,240 --> 00:13:35,797
Even if I am the creation
of another entity.

199
00:13:35,880 --> 00:13:38,337
My mind is my own.

200
00:13:38,420 --> 00:13:42,617
And I will protect this world
and all the people in it.

201
00:13:42,700 --> 00:13:44,957
Regardless what they want!

202
00:13:45,040 --> 00:13:46,560
That is my mission!

203
00:13:48,540 --> 00:13:49,370
Alice...

204
00:13:53,640 --> 00:13:57,700
Kirito, to break this,
I need you to hold me.

205
00:13:58,640 --> 00:13:59,470
Sure.

206
00:14:02,680 --> 00:14:06,520
Hear me, Administrator,
and you heartless gods.

207
00:14:07,660 --> 00:14:14,080
For the sake of my mission, and
this world, I hereby renounce you!

208
00:14:27,020 --> 00:14:28,580
EUGEO? EUGEO?

209
00:14:35,080 --> 00:14:36,717
You must be cold.

210
00:14:36,800 --> 00:14:39,520
Come on, it's warmer here. Hurry!

211
00:14:51,000 --> 00:14:52,740
Mother, is it really you?

212
00:14:53,180 --> 00:14:54,720
Of course it is.

213
00:14:55,100 --> 00:14:56,780
Now who else would I be?

214
00:15:04,400 --> 00:15:05,380
Where's father?

215
00:15:05,720 --> 00:15:08,240
And my brothers? Where are they?

216
00:15:10,100 --> 00:15:12,260
Silly child, don't you remember?

217
00:15:12,620 --> 00:15:13,860
You killed them all.

218
00:15:25,220 --> 00:15:27,000
What happened to me?

219
00:15:28,160 --> 00:15:29,820
How did I get here?

220
00:15:31,380 --> 00:15:37,100
The last thing I remember was
fighting Bercouli from the legend.

221
00:15:37,820 --> 00:15:39,980
Then a little man appeared.

222
00:15:40,680 --> 00:15:41,510
Chudelkin.

223
00:15:42,180 --> 00:15:44,980
And after that, I woke up.

224
00:15:45,980 --> 00:15:47,080
But where?

225
00:15:50,560 --> 00:15:54,040
Is this the top floor of
the central cathedral?

226
00:16:04,900 --> 00:16:08,860
If this is the top
floor, that must be her.

227
00:16:29,080 --> 00:16:31,800
No, Eugeo! Run!

228
00:16:37,960 --> 00:16:39,897
She's the Pontifex.

229
00:16:39,980 --> 00:16:40,997
Administrator.

230
00:16:41,080 --> 00:16:42,760
Now's my chance.

231
00:16:43,800 --> 00:16:46,540
No, I can't use the dagger on her.

232
00:16:46,920 --> 00:16:48,740
I was saving it for Alice.

233
00:16:49,300 --> 00:16:50,760
You two! Run!

234
00:17:10,500 --> 00:17:12,200
You pitiful thing.

235
00:17:13,740 --> 00:17:14,570
Pitiful?

236
00:17:14,840 --> 00:17:15,680
That's right.

237
00:17:15,960 --> 00:17:17,560
You look so miserable.

238
00:17:17,980 --> 00:17:21,240
Just like a flower,
withering away in a pot.

239
00:17:21,600 --> 00:17:24,540
A flower? Me? Yes.

240
00:17:24,800 --> 00:17:26,957
If you could see yourself, you'd agree.

241
00:17:27,040 --> 00:17:30,780
You look parched. Starving. For what?

242
00:17:31,540 --> 00:17:33,580
For love. Love?

243
00:17:33,800 --> 00:17:34,640
No way.

244
00:17:35,300 --> 00:17:36,280
You're wrong.

245
00:17:36,460 --> 00:17:38,720
I am loved by lots of people.

246
00:17:38,940 --> 00:17:42,175
You've never known what it
means to be loved by anyone.

247
00:17:42,760 --> 00:17:44,460
That's why you're so sad.

248
00:17:44,960 --> 00:17:46,060
That's not true.

249
00:17:46,760 --> 00:17:47,800
There's my mom.

250
00:17:48,260 --> 00:17:49,400
She loved me.

251
00:17:50,000 --> 00:17:52,824
Whenever I had a nightmare
and I couldn't sleep,

252
00:17:53,000 --> 00:17:56,257
she'd hold me and sing lullabies
to make me feel better.

253
00:17:56,340 --> 00:17:57,500
Perhaps she did.

254
00:17:57,680 --> 00:17:59,960
But was that love meant only for you?

255
00:18:00,320 --> 00:18:01,660
You know it wasn't.

256
00:18:01,800 --> 00:18:05,682
It was what she had left over after
sharing it with your brothers.

257
00:18:06,260 --> 00:18:07,100
No way.

258
00:18:07,340 --> 00:18:08,440
She loved me.

259
00:18:08,800 --> 00:18:09,700
She did.

260
00:18:09,840 --> 00:18:11,817
I was the one she loved the most.

261
00:18:11,900 --> 00:18:16,540
You wanted her love all for yourself,
but she loved the others more.

262
00:18:16,880 --> 00:18:18,640
That's why you hate them so.

263
00:18:19,060 --> 00:18:24,100
Your father, your brothers,
they stole it. Stop it. Liar.

264
00:18:24,340 --> 00:18:26,720
I don't hate my father or my brothers.

265
00:18:26,980 --> 00:18:28,300
I am not jealous.

266
00:18:28,620 --> 00:18:29,760
Oh, but you are.

267
00:18:30,040 --> 00:18:32,099
Why else would you attack that boy?

268
00:18:32,660 --> 00:18:33,560
What boy?

269
00:18:33,900 --> 00:18:37,737
The one who came between you and
the red-haired girl who loved you.

270
00:18:37,820 --> 00:18:39,277
Who loved only you.

271
00:18:39,360 --> 00:18:45,380
When the boy kidnapped her and tried
to defile her, you wanted to kill him.

272
00:18:45,960 --> 00:18:49,320
You hated him because he took
something that was yours.

273
00:18:51,400 --> 00:18:52,320
You're wrong.

274
00:18:52,580 --> 00:18:53,457
That's not...

275
00:18:53,540 --> 00:18:56,800
I didn't attack Raios
because I was jealous of him.

276
00:18:57,080 --> 00:18:59,200
And yet here you are, alone.

277
00:19:00,200 --> 00:19:01,680
No one loves you.

278
00:19:02,180 --> 00:19:05,651
They decided they don't need
you anymore and abandoned you.

279
00:19:05,740 --> 00:19:09,160
By now, they've forgotten about you. No.

280
00:19:09,360 --> 00:19:10,500
You're lying.

281
00:19:10,940 --> 00:19:14,120
There's still someone who wants me.

282
00:19:15,820 --> 00:19:17,500
Alice, that's it.

283
00:19:17,780 --> 00:19:19,260
Alice still needs me.

284
00:19:20,440 --> 00:19:21,357
Are you sure?

285
00:19:21,440 --> 00:19:22,860
Does she love you?

286
00:19:23,180 --> 00:19:25,720
Does she love you and only you?

287
00:19:27,700 --> 00:19:29,497
You seem to have forgotten.

288
00:19:29,580 --> 00:19:31,280
I can help you remember.

289
00:19:31,720 --> 00:19:36,920
You have buried the memory deep within
your heart, but I can unearth it.

290
00:19:42,800 --> 00:19:45,560
I haven't seen Kirito
and Alice all morning.

291
00:19:46,140 --> 00:19:47,340
Where could they be?

292
00:19:52,940 --> 00:19:53,770
Alice...

293
00:19:54,340 --> 00:19:57,680
But, like, what if he comes
looking? Let's go back.

294
00:19:58,120 --> 00:20:00,460
But we're almost finished. Let's stay.

295
00:20:00,680 --> 00:20:02,520
Just a bit longer. Please?

296
00:20:05,240 --> 00:20:06,070
No.

297
00:20:09,360 --> 00:20:10,520
This isn't real.

298
00:20:11,020 --> 00:20:12,200
It didn't happen.

299
00:20:12,460 --> 00:20:13,560
I told you so.

300
00:20:17,740 --> 00:20:19,380
Now do you believe me?

301
00:20:19,640 --> 00:20:21,200
She doesn't love you.

302
00:20:21,380 --> 00:20:24,400
Not just you, at any rate. Poor thing.

303
00:20:24,820 --> 00:20:28,520
In fact, she didn't have any
love for you from the start.

304
00:20:31,240 --> 00:20:33,980
I'm nothing like that girl, Eugeo.

305
00:20:34,240 --> 00:20:36,260
I would be happy to love you.

306
00:20:36,580 --> 00:20:37,877
I'd give you all of it.

307
00:20:37,960 --> 00:20:40,400
Just you and no one else.

308
00:20:44,500 --> 00:20:46,660
No one else.

309
00:20:57,800 --> 00:21:00,840
Now, come closer, Eugeo.

310
00:21:04,160 --> 00:21:09,257
I will show you what love is, and
you can love me as much as you want.

311
00:21:09,340 --> 00:21:15,600
If you give me all of your love, I will
give you all the love I have in return!

312
00:21:16,840 --> 00:21:22,137
And the deeper your love is for me, the
more of its pleasures will I then show you?

313
00:21:22,220 --> 00:21:25,360
Pleasures beyond your wildest dreams.

314
00:21:26,340 --> 00:21:29,680
Is that really what love is about?

315
00:21:31,420 --> 00:21:33,000
A thing you trade?

316
00:21:33,480 --> 00:21:34,537
Like money?

317
00:21:34,620 --> 00:21:36,360
Is that all it is?

318
00:21:36,780 --> 00:21:37,980
No, Eugeo!

319
00:21:41,040 --> 00:21:42,260
That's not true!

320
00:21:42,480 --> 00:21:43,421
That isn't love!

321
00:21:53,080 --> 00:21:54,800
Don't be fooled, Eugeo!

322
00:21:57,040 --> 00:21:58,300
Love isn't like that.

323
00:21:58,540 --> 00:22:01,599
You don't give your love
to get something in return?

324
00:22:08,180 --> 00:22:09,010
You do!

325
00:22:33,520 --> 00:22:35,520
I know what you want.

326
00:22:36,340 --> 00:22:42,380
You want to forget all of your sadness
and make love to me till the end of time.

327
00:22:42,780 --> 00:22:44,360
You will, but not yet.

328
00:22:44,980 --> 00:22:48,760
First, my dear, I must
have proof of your love.

329
00:22:49,060 --> 00:22:53,497
You will trust only in me and
offer all of yourself to me.

330
00:22:53,580 --> 00:22:57,140
When I tell you what words
to say, you will say them.

331
00:22:57,860 --> 00:23:01,200
Now, initiate the sacred arts.

332
00:23:01,940 --> 00:23:03,520
System call.

333
00:23:04,100 --> 00:23:04,930
Good.

334
00:23:05,013 --> 00:23:06,340
Now repeat after me.

335
00:23:07,000 --> 00:23:09,120
Remove core protection.

336
00:23:09,980 --> 00:23:10,810
Remove?

337
00:23:11,720 --> 00:23:14,800
Am I doing the right thing?

338
00:23:15,540 --> 00:23:16,370
Core.

339
00:23:16,620 --> 00:23:18,740
I don't want to be sad anymore.

340
00:23:19,760 --> 00:23:21,660
I don't want to be alone.

341
00:23:22,140 --> 00:23:23,040
That's it.

342
00:23:23,580 --> 00:23:24,410
Good.

343
00:23:24,493 --> 00:23:25,323
You're almost done.

344
00:23:25,600 --> 00:23:26,720
Come into me.

345
00:23:27,160 --> 00:23:29,580
Into eternal stasis.

346
00:23:30,560 --> 00:23:31,480
Protection.

347
00:23:36,580 --> 00:23:38,140
Next time. Synthesis.
